{"title": "Five levels of trader", "type": "Trader levels", "hooks": ["Five levels of trader. Only one survived this fake breakout.", "Five traders, one breakout. Only one had a plan.", "Level one buys green. Level five buys this breakout."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Five levels of trader. Only one survived this fake breakout.", "text": "Five levels of trader", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 1", "vo": "Level one buys whatever just went up. Green candle? Buy. Red candle? Panic.", "chart": null, "figures": [{"pose": "happy", "label": "Level 1", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "Green candle? Buy.", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Green means buy!"}, {"say": "Red candle? Panic.", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "panic"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 2", "vo": "Level two learns the word breakout and buys the first close above the high. No stop. Just hope.", "chart": null, "figures": [{"pose": "think", "label": "Level 2", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "buys the first close", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "It broke out!"}, {"say": "No stop. Just hope.", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "shrug"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 3", "vo": "Level three checks the volume. This break came on half the usual volume, and closed back inside within six candles. Skipped.", "chart": 0, "show": 90, "figures": [{"pose": "point", "label": "Level 3", "color": "teal"}], "cues": [{"say": "Level three checks the volume", "do": "line", "price": 62.18, "label": "20-candle high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "half the usual volume", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Half the volume?"}, {"say": "closed back inside", "do": "reveal", "to": 92}, {"say": "Skipped.", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "happy"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 4", "vo": "Level four waits for a close beyond the level, then a retest that holds.", "chart": null, "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 4", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "waits for a close", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "think"}, {"say": "a retest that holds", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Show me the retest"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 5", "vo": "Level five sets the stop first, just inside the old range. If the breakout is fake, the loss stays small.", "chart": null, "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 5", "color": "amber"}], "cues": [{"say": "sets the stop first", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "the loss stays small", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Stop first. Then buy."}]}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Which level are you?", "vo": "Comment your level, then practise on fictional charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Five levels of trader. Only one survived this fake breakout.\n\nThe price closed above the 20-candle high on half the usual volume.\nWithin six candles it closed back inside the range.\nLevel five set the stop first, so the loss stayed small.\n\nWhich level are you? Tell me in the comments.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #TradingForBeginners #Breakout #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[60.06, 62.08, 59.99, 62.06, 33516], [62.06, 62.92, 62.05, 62.45, 27381], [62.45, 62.62, 62.16, 62.59, 35587], [62.58, 64.39, 62.58, 64.02, 29651], [64.01, 64.5, 63.85, 64.38, 41429], [64.38, 64.48, 62.99, 64.0, 63043], [64.0, 64.47, 62.24, 62.31, 63954], [62.31, 65.06, 61.4, 64.34, 125357], [64.32, 64.41, 62.35, 62.91, 40815], [62.92, 63.79, 62.78, 62.89, 58380], [62.9, 63.6, 62.26, 63.53, 29614], [63.53, 63.85, 61.92, 62.82, 89834], [62.81, 63.32, 62.54, 62.95, 44169], [62.96, 62.99, 61.44, 61.55, 47615], [61.57, 61.75, 60.2, 60.22, 40540], [60.23, 60.51, 58.4, 58.89, 87431], [58.9, 59.29, 56.56, 56.76, 69151], [56.73, 57.13, 54.74, 55.55, 144914], [55.5, 57.99, 55.16, 57.99, 125463], [57.98, 58.96, 57.73, 58.79, 67240], [58.79, 58.89, 57.89, 57.9, 49150], [57.91, 59.56, 56.55, 57.4, 2389